      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Drawn by Claude, 2026-10-05, from the body-fetch spike. A PROPOSAL to correct — draw on it, save, tell me.\nZooms into the \"Body extractor\" box on the main board (system.excalidraw). One job in front of both pipelines,\nso retiring production = switching off its job; the intake and v0 carry on.",
