      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "OPEN QUESTIONS (red)\n1. When ours and Readability both read a page, which text wins?  → review page 1\n2. Should the stations read headline + summary when there is no text?  → review page 2\n3. Retry window: 48 h, the same as the tier-1 posting limit (D34)?\n4. Its own Cloud Run job at :07, or the first step of v0's job?\n5. Tables in v0's database, read by production through a read-only login?",
      "originalText": "OPEN QUESTIONS (red)\n1. When ours and Readability both read a page, which text wins?  → review page 1\n2. Should the stations read headline + summary when there is no text?  → review page 2\n3. Retry window: 48 h, the same as the tier-1 posting limit (D34)?\n4. Its own Cloud Run job at :07, or the first step of v0's job?\n5. Tables in v0's database, read by production through a read-only login?",
